{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">From a Different Angle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this 3D puzzle game, you will find yourself in a space laboratory dedicated to studying gravity. You will face numerous challenges that require you to see the world <strong>from a different angle</strong>\u2014because here, gravity can be directed in any direction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520800/extras/v3.gif?t=1741034218\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What You'll Find in This Game:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of exciting levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 10 unique interactive objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A chance to test your sense of balance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Platforming sections</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Level Editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the levels created by the developers aren't enough for you, you can create your own! The game features a flexible level editor to bring your ideas to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520800/extras/v1.png?t=1741034218\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Signal System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The level editor includes its own visual programming language to expand your creative possibilities. It allows you to transform simple signals (such as pressing a button) into more complex computations.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520800/extras/v2.png?t=1741034218\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520800?t=1741034218","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520800?t=1741034218","capsule_image"